<title>USA: Microage sees Q4 revs over $1 billion.</title>
<headline>Microage sees Q4 revs over $1 billion.</headline>
<dateline>TEMPE, Ariz. 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>MicroAge Inc said revenue for the fourth quarter ended November 3 is expected to be over $1 billion, up about 30 percent from last year's fourth quarter.</p>
<p>It said revenues for the full year are expected to total $3.5 billion.  Results are due to be released December 12.</p>
</text>
